The '''Déjà Vu Alley''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Village Plaza}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It leads to the {{Zone|Living Cave}}.

== Features ==
The '''Déjà Vu Alley''' features a few attractions.

=== Red Light, Green Light ===
The '''Déjà Vu Alley''' is filled with particles and blocks of a certain color. Every few seconds, starting off with green, all colored blocks and particles in the Alley will turn to a different color. When it is {{Green|green}}, players are safe to walk. Soon after, the Alley will turn {{Yellow|yellow}}, indicating that soon it will turn {{Red|red}}. If the player enters or moves (including camera movements) inside the '''Déjà Vu Alley''' whilst it is red, they will be flung up into the air in the {{zone|Village Plaza}} and {{stat|rt|100}} will be subtracted from their time remaining.

=== Reverse-Murder Investigation ===
{{Main|Detective Amog|Blacksmith (Rift)}}
After purchasing the {{Item|Tactician's Murder Weapon}} from {{NPCSprite|Master Tactician Fink}}, {{NPCSprite|Detective Amog}} will appear in one of the houses in the '''Déjà Vu Alley''', next to the [[Blacksmith (Rift)|Blacksmith]]. After talking to the [[Blacksmith (Rift)|Blacksmith]], the player must go back to the {{zone|Murder House}} in order to search for more clues to progress in the quest.

